---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Hybrid Vehicle Services - Taqwa Automobile Service Center"
  description="Specialized hybrid vehicle service in Uttara, Dhaka. Certified diagnostics, battery repair, inverter and ECU service for Toyota Prius, Aqua, Axio Hybrid, Corolla Hybrid and more at Taqwa Automobile."
  path="hybrid-services.html"
  current="hybrid"
>

<style>
  /* Everything shared with the rest of the site (tokens, reset, icon/reveal/
     lazy-load/sticky-actions utilities, header, mobile nav, buttons/eyebrow,
     responsive header rules, footer, page-banner + breadcrumb, why-choose,
     FAQ base, services-recap section, the about-style CTA banner, hybrid
     service process, and the shared .hybrid-content/.svc-reason-item/
     .hybrid-illustration selectors) now lives in src/styles/global.css.
     Only the handful of declarations below are genuinely specific to this
     page — where this page reuses a class name from the homepage's hybrid
     card grid (.hybrid-grid, .hybrid-features-strip) with a different
     column count/gap, or its own background-glow position. */
  .hybrid-panel::before{mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 75% 50%, black, transparent);}
  .hybrid-grid{gap:26px 22px;}
  .hybrid-features-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);}
  @media (max-width:1100px){
    .hybrid-illustration{display:none;}
  }

  /* This page's FAQ accordion uses a snappier, non-eased transition than the
     smoother default in global.css (shared with the 4 service-detail pages) —
     preserved exactly as before. */
  .faq-question{transition:none;}
  .faq-question .faq-arrow::before, .faq-question .faq-arrow::after{
    transition:transform .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .faq-answer{transition:max-height .3s ease;}
</style>


<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="page-banner-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">SPECIALIZED CARE</div>
    <h1 class="display reveal">HYBRID <span class="accent">VEHICLE SERVICES</span></h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb reveal">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">»</span>
      <span class="current">Hybrid Services</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-section">
  <div class="hybrid-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-panel reveal">

      <div class="hybrid-header">
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">BUILT FOR <span class="accent">HYBRID TECHNOLOGY</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-content">
        <div class="story-content" style="position:relative;">
          <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px;">Hybrid vehicles like the Toyota Prius, Aqua, Axio Hybrid and Corolla Hybrid run on complex battery, motor and inverter systems that a standard workshop isn't equipped to handle. At Taqwa Automobile, our technicians are specially trained on hybrid drivetrains, high-voltage battery packs and regenerative braking systems.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">From battery diagnostics to full ECU scanning, we use manufacturer-approved tools and genuine parts to keep your hybrid running safely, efficiently and true to its factory performance.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hybrid-illustration">
          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="lazy-fade" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')" src={base + "img/hybrid-car.jpg"} alt="Hybrid vehicle service illustration" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-grid" style="margin-top:30px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative;">

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>High-Voltage Safety</h4>
            <p>Hybrid battery packs carry high-voltage current. Our technicians follow strict safety protocols to work on these systems without risk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="8" y2="22" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Complex Software Systems</h4>
            <p>Hybrid drivetrains rely on precise software calibration between the engine, motor and battery — errors here affect performance and safety.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="2" height="4" fill="#F97316"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Specialized Tools Required</h4>
            <p>Standard workshop equipment can't safely diagnose hybrid components. We use manufacturer-approved diagnostic tools built for the job.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Longer Battery Life</h4>
            <p>Correct maintenance and early diagnostics can significantly extend the life of your hybrid battery, saving you from costly early replacement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-features-strip">
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 8h8v8H8z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>Advanced Diagnostic Equipment</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M21 12h-3M6 12H3M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1M18.4 18.4l-2.1-2.1M7.7 7.7 5.6 5.6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>Genuine Parts &amp; Quality Service</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 8-7 9-4-1-7-4.5-7-9V5l7-3z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Certified &amp; Trained Hybrid Technicians</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>100% Safety Guarantee</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Better Performance &amp; Fuel Efficiency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item reveal">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M8 14l2.3 2.3L16 11" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Manufacturer Standard Service Process</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-process-section">
  <div class="hybrid-process-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-process-header reveal">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR HYBRID <span class="accent">SERVICE PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p>From first inspection to final road test, every hybrid that comes into our workshop follows the same careful, manufacturer-standard process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-process-steps">

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">01</div>
        <h3>Initial Hybrid Health Check</h3>
        <p>We start with a full visual and computer-based inspection covering the battery, inverter, motor and charging system.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">02</div>
        <h3>Battery &amp; High-Voltage Diagnostics</h3>
        <p>Cell-by-cell battery testing and voltage checks to pinpoint exactly which cells or components need attention.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">03</div>
        <h3>Certified Repair or Replacement</h3>
        <p>Faulty parts are repaired or replaced using genuine, manufacturer-approved components — never generic substitutes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">04</div>
        <h3>System Calibration &amp; ECU Reset</h3>
        <p>After any repair, we recalibrate the hybrid control software so every system works together as the manufacturer intended.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">05</div>
        <h3>Full Road Test</h3>
        <p>Every hybrid is road tested under real driving conditions to confirm smooth power delivery and regenerative braking performance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">06</div>
        <h3>Warranty &amp; Ongoing Support</h3>
        <p>We back our hybrid work with a service warranty and are always available for follow-up checks and questions.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-recap-section">
  <div class="services-recap-inner">
    <div class="services-recap-header reveal">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR <span class="accent">HYBRID SERVICES</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="2" height="4" fill="#fff"/><path d="M6 12h2l1.2-2.5L11 15l1.2-3h2.3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Hybrid Battery Diagnostics</h3>
          <p>We diagnose the health and performance of your hybrid battery cell by cell to ensure reliability and safety.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="2" y="8" width="13" height="9" rx="1.3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><rect x="15" y="10.5" width="2" height="4" fill="#fff"/><path d="M19.5 3.5a2.7 2.7 0 00-3.6 3.6L9 14v3h3l7.1-7.1a2.7 2.7 0 003.6-3.6l-1.8 1.8-1.8-1.8z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Battery Repair &amp; Replacement</h3>
          <p>Professional repair or replacement of hybrid batteries with high quality cells and full warranty coverage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h4V6h4v12h4V6h4v12h4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Inverter Inspection &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Inspection and repair of the inverter to ensure smooth power conversion and long-term system efficiency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Hybrid System Diagnostics</h3>
          <p>Complete diagnostic scan of the hybrid system to detect issues early and ensure optimal performance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0113-6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17 6l-1-3.5L20 4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 01-13 6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 18l1 3.5L4 20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Motor &amp; Generator Service</h3>
          <p>Inspection, repair, and maintenance of the hybrid motor and generator for maximum efficiency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="21" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><line x1="5" y1="7" x2="19" y2="17" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><line x1="19" y1="7" x2="5" y2="17" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Hybrid AC Service</h3>
          <p>Specialized AC service for hybrid vehicles using compatible equipment and manufacturer-approved techniques.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="8" y2="22" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="2" y1="8" x2="6" y2="8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="18" y1="8" x2="22" y2="8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="2" y1="16" x2="6" y2="16" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="18" y1="16" x2="22" y2="16" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Hybrid ECU Scanning</h3>
          <p>Advanced ECU scanning and coding to identify faults and reset hybrid control modules accurately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M12 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 018.5 8.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M22 8l-1.5-2L18 7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Regenerative Brake Service</h3>
          <p>Inspection and service of the regenerative braking system to ensure safety and smooth operation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="why-choose-inner">

    <div class="why-choose-content reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow-line">Why Trust Us</div>
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.3px;">With Your <span class="accent">Hybrid</span>?</h2>
      <p>Hybrid systems are unforgiving of guesswork. Our workshop combines manufacturer-standard training with the right tools to service your hybrid the right way, every time.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-learn">
        Book a Hybrid Checkup
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="why-choose-grid">

      <div class="wc-card tech">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="lazy-fade" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')" src={base + "img/expert-technitian.jpg"} alt="Hybrid-Certified Technicians" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Hybrid-Certified Technicians</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card tools">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="lazy-fade" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')" src={base + "img/car-parts.jpg"} alt="Genuine Hybrid Parts" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Genuine Hybrid Parts</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card parts">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="lazy-fade" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')" src={base + "img/advanced-tools.jpg"} alt="Advanced Diagnostic Tools" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Advanced Diagnostic Tools</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card service">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="lazy-fade" onload="this.classList.add('is-loaded')" src={base + "img/Trusted-Service.jpg"} alt="Safety-First Process" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Safety-First Process</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header reveal">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">HYBRID SERVICE <span class="accent">FAQ</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-column">

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How long do hybrid batteries typically last?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Most hybrid batteries are designed to last 8&ndash;10 years or more with proper care. Regular diagnostics can catch early degradation before it affects performance.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Which hybrid vehicles do you service?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">We service popular hybrid models commonly found in Bangladesh, including Toyota Prius, Aqua, Axio Hybrid and Corolla Hybrid, among others.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Is hybrid battery repair covered under warranty?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, our hybrid battery repairs and replacements come with a service warranty. Ask our team for details specific to your vehicle.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do hybrid cars need different AC servicing?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes. Hybrid AC systems often use electric compressors that require specialized equipment and refrigerant handling, which our technicians are trained for.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How often should I get hybrid system diagnostics done?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">We recommend a full hybrid diagnostic scan at least once a year, or immediately if you notice reduced fuel efficiency or dashboard warning lights.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-cta-section" id="contact">
  <div class="about-cta-inner">
    <h2 class="reveal">Give Your Hybrid the Care It Deserves</h2>
    <p class="reveal">Book a hybrid diagnostic checkup or ask our specialists a question &mdash; call, message us on WhatsApp, or visit our workshop in Uttara.</p>
    <div class="about-cta-address reveal">
      <svg class="icon" width="15" height="15" style="color:#F97316"><use href="#icon-location"/></svg>
      <span>Sector # 15, Block # C, Road # 3/A, Plot # 40, Diabari, Uttara, Dhaka.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-cta-actions reveal">
      <a href="tel:+8801854226757" class="btn btn-red">
        <svg class="icon" width="14" height="14"><use href="#icon-phone"/></svg>
        Call Now
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801854226757" class="btn btn-green">
        <svg class="icon" width="14" height="14"><use href="#icon-whatsapp"/></svg>
        WhatsApp Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


</Layout>
